{
    "song_id": 12397751,
    "title": "City Walls",
    "language": "en",
    "lyricists": "[50268, 574050]",
    "lyrics": [
        {
            "section_id": "section_1",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Square up with me, I can take your right, throw a left",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Pair up with me, I'ma take you right to the chest",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Warpath etched in the surface",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Lines of the yellow tape, they're moving quiet like a",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Serpentine in a formation",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Buddy, that's my team, pretty impatient",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Now they're waiting on me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "It might be the furthest we've reached",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "Now move it up, move it up, it's a breach",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "I wonder where you are",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I wanted you to show me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "The way around those city walls",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "The way on through",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "I wonder where you are",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "I wanted you to show me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "But now the night has fallen",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Abandoned by the sun",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_3",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Square up with me, I can come to you, tell me when",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Pair up with me, I can run on you, in the end",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "I write a promise in pencil, but my loyalty's in pen",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Use a mistake as a crooked stencil, then we trace it back again",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "From the mainland to the island of violence",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "It was the same plan for a while, decided",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "To send me up and rip you outta your seat",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "You see, in a city with no entrance, there is not a retreat",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "I'm wondering what you thought would happen, who you thought I would be",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "Was this a sideswipe or did you picture this in a dream?",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "Buckle down, this is possibly the furthest we've reached",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "Now move it up, move it up, it's a breach",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                }
            ]
        },
